# not meant to live in git history) ---
main_cap/cap/deployed_model_backup_*/
# --- runtime data: SQLite database, uploaded resumes (PII), Flask secret key ---
main_cap/cap/instance/
# --- copyrighted textbook / slide sources for the RAG knowledge base (local only) ---
